        "TileImage": "$($repository 4218dd14-8024-4fef-86fb-65e97cd65f59).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, \r              Your destination is On Top of The World [DUBAI], Our providence contact has shared the identity of two of the most dangerous members of &quot;THE MAELSTROMS&quot; hiding under their fake names, Omar Al-Ghazali and Lisa Thorn. \r \rUnfortunately, Al-Ghazali is very careful man as he only walks with the crowd and only DRINKS what he trust. So, Be smart about this 47.\r\rLisa is a very active person, so be aware of her moves.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
